"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p024","quote":"齊侯太公和立二年，和卒，子桓公午立。桓公午五年，秦、魏攻韓，韓求救於齊。齊桓公召大臣而謀曰：「蚤救之孰與晩救之？」騶忌曰：「不若勿救。」段干朋曰：「不救，則韓且折而入於魏，不若救之。」田臣思曰：「過矣君之謀也！秦、魏攻韓、楚，趙必救之，是天以燕予齊也。」桓公曰：「善」。乃陰告韓使者而遣之。韓自以爲得齊之救，因與秦、魏戰。楚、趙聞之，果起兵而救之。齊因起兵襲燕國，取桑丘。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"和卒，子桓公午立","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"明示子、女及生子語境保存；繼位、太子或後宮數量不單獨補世系，其他篇世系仍待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji046-016","person_id":"cbr-p002733","title":"相齊","kind":"unclassified","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p021","quote":"田太公相齊宣公。宣公四十八年，取魯之城。明年，宣公與鄭人會西城。伐衞，取毋丘。宣公五十一年卒，田會自廩丘反。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji046-016:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p021","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"相齊","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m021-0000","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授予、任事與文獻用稱分存；欲使為卿且辭未當已任，諡稱不當生前任職，死亡或首次用稱不補任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji046-017","person_id":"cbr-p002733","title":"齊侯","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p023","quote":"三年，太公與魏文侯會濁澤，求爲諸侯。魏文侯乃使使言周天子及諸侯，請立齊相田和爲諸侯。周天子許之。康公之十九年，田和立爲齊侯，列於周室，紀元年。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji046-017:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p023","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"齊侯","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m023-0055","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":"康公之十九年","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p023","quote":"三年，太公與魏文侯會濁澤，求爲諸侯。魏文侯乃使使言周天子及諸侯，請立齊相田和爲諸侯。周天子許之。康公之十九年，田和立爲齊侯，列於周室，紀元年。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授予、任事與文獻用稱分存；欲使為卿且辭未當已任，諡稱不當生前任職，死亡或首次用稱不補任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji046-027","person_id":"cbr-p002733","surfaces":["和","太公","太公和","田和","田太公","齊侯太公和","齊相田和"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-046-tian"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p020","quote":"田莊子相齊宣公。宣公四十三年，伐晉，毀黃城，圍陽狐。明年，伐魯、葛及安陵。明年，取魯之一城。莊子卒，子太公和立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p021","quote":"田太公相齊宣公。宣公四十八年，取魯之城。明年，宣公與鄭人會西城。伐衞，取毋丘。宣公五十一年卒，田會自廩丘反。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p022","quote":"宣公卒，子康公貸立。貸立十四年，淫於酒婦人，不聽政。太公乃遷康公於海上，食一城，以奉其先祀。明年，魯敗齊平陸。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p023","quote":"三年，太公與魏文侯會濁澤，求爲諸侯。魏文侯乃使使言周天子及諸侯，請立齊相田和爲諸侯。周天子許之。康公之十九年，田和立爲齊侯，列於周室，紀元年。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p024","quote":"齊侯太公和立二年，和卒，子桓公午立。桓公午五年，秦、魏攻韓，韓求救於齊。齊桓公召大臣而謀曰：「蚤救之孰與晩救之？」騶忌曰：「不若勿救。」段干朋曰：「不救，則韓且折而入於魏，不若救之。」田臣思曰：「過矣君之謀也！秦、魏攻韓、楚，趙必救之，是天以燕予齊也。」桓公曰：「善」。乃陰告韓使者而遣之。韓自以爲得齊之救，因與秦、魏戰。楚、趙聞之，果起兵而救之。齊因起兵襲燕國，取桑丘。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為、繼位及局部事件暫接；姜齊與田齊桓公、不同時段未名王及同字忌分開。孫子不先補孫臏，子守髙唐不補闕字，索隱短稱與代詞仍待核；未跨篇按同名接人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p020","text":"田莊子相齊宣公。宣公四十三年，伐晉，毀黃城，圍陽狐。明年，伐魯、葛及安陵。明年，取魯之一城。莊子卒，子太公和立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m020-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"田莊子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002732","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m020-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"齊宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002731","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m020-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002731","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m020-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"莊子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002732","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m020-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"太公和","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002733","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p021","text":"田太公相齊宣公。宣公四十八年，取魯之城。明年，宣公與鄭人會西城。伐衞，取毋丘。宣公五十一年卒，田會自廩丘反。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m021-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"田太公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002733","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m021-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"齊宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002731","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m021-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002731","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m021-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002731","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m021-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002731","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m021-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"田會","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002783","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p022","text":"宣公卒，子康公貸立。貸立十四年，淫於酒婦人，不聽政。太公乃遷康公於海上，食一城，以奉其先祀。明年，魯敗齊平陸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m022-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002731","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m022-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"康公貸","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002755","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m022-0010","s