},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p024","text":"齊侯太公和立二年，和卒，子桓公午立。桓公午五年，秦、魏攻韓，韓求救於齊。齊桓公召大臣而謀曰：「蚤救之孰與晩救之？」騶忌曰：「不若勿救。」段干朋曰：「不救，則韓且折而入於魏，不若救之。」田臣思曰：「過矣君之謀也！秦、魏攻韓、楚，趙必救之，是天以燕予齊也。」桓公曰：「善」。乃陰告韓使者而遣之。韓自以爲得齊之救，因與秦、魏戰。楚、趙聞之，果起兵而救之。齊因起兵襲燕國，取桑丘。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"齊侯太公和","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002733","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"和","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002733","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"桓公午","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002758","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"桓公午","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002758","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002758","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"大臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"騶忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002759","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0068","start":68,"end":71,"surface":"段干朋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002760","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0092","start":92,"end":95,"surface":"田臣思","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002761","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002758","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0138","start":138,"end":141,"surface":"韓使者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-046","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian","source":{"title":"史記／卷046","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷046","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷046&oldid=2560838","revision_id":2560838,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"55段正文（含太史公論贊）及1段索隱述贊，後者另標witness_appended_suoyin_zan；排除2個dd導覽及現代分節標題。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"取得時HTML與固定修訂一致，只去除段落外緣空白；保留［二］、（粟）［稟］、晏（孺子）［圉］、（帥）［師］、笔及称等數位見證原字，不暗改。","note":"已讀全56段數位文字並作明示人名首輪；未核可靠底本、影像或現代研究。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":true}}
